        <key>roleRationale</key>
        <string>Keep genuine SC T top and middle optical roles because their upper body and shaft are retained. Place side at the retained upper crossbar right edge. Below/ogonek use the complete terminal ink bottom and the centre of its one-unit-above-bottom ink slice. Do not copy native zero default roles or an unrelated deep native anchor: the two terminals have different actual extents. New source roles are explicit placement hypotheses; actual attachments/stacks remain required.</string>
